WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.910
Estimate stuck before it reaches the customer?
Nepsis maps,

00:00:04.159 --> 00:00:07.385
improves, tests and hands over
one recurring workflow.

00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:10.353
Follow this estimate
from request to sent.

00:00:11.096 --> 00:00:12.813
Now watch where
the estimate stops.

00:00:13.276 --> 00:00:16.800
The owner’s tray is not just
full of pricing work.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.426
One pack has measurements
but no photographs.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:23.224
Another has a scope question
with no named person to answer it.

00:00:23.284 --> 00:00:26.381
A third looks complete
until pricing begins.

00:00:26.441 --> 00:00:30.750
The owner is receiving work that is nearly ready,
then chasing what is missing.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.121
The hold is the readiness
handoff into pricing.
